WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,130
Stop the car, Xu Qing

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,760
That rocket is not powerful enough

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,120
Like why the ability has been strengthened?

4
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:10,680
The same way as my enchantment

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,840
You can also turn in the air and change the route at any time.

6
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:20,810
There are talented people and vehicles hidden in this barracks, so keep them on the outer road to avoid trouble.

7
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:33,180
