8
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,140
The one without weapons

9
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:50,640
That's their real land card. Hello, how do you call me Wang Sheng Suhao?

10
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,040
You were the one who killed Juhe, right?

11
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,640
They caused us heavy losses last night

12
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:54,760
This helps a lot

13
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,600
Not only is this house temporarily

14
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,640
Maybe there are also small cranes and crane eggs.
